{:edb/db-before-t 2581 :edb/db-after-t 2582 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535894 50 #inst "2026-10-09T10:07:31.201Z" 13194139535894 true] [17592186129113 1020 #edb/ref 17592186373070 13194139535894 true] [17592186129113 1020 #edb/ref 17592186373091 13194139535894 true] [17592186129115 1020 #edb/ref 17592186373063 13194139535894 true] [17592186129115 1020 #edb/ref 17592186373077 13194139535894 true] [17592186129115 1020 #edb/ref 17592186373084 13194139535894 true] [17592186373063 1017 #edb/ref 17592186373064 13194139535894 true] [17592186373063 1089 "q-129481" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373063 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535894 true] [17592186373063 1100 "Find the equation of the tangent hyperplane to the hypersurface $w=z\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+1)$ at the point $(0,0,3,0).$" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373063 1113 #uuid "e4368e6b-b80a-5e9c-837a-95c1d6864a8a" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373063 1145 "The Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the hypersurface $w=f(x,y,z)$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0},{w}_{0})$ on the hypersurface can be written as\n\n$$\nw-{w}_{0}=(x-{x}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂x}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})+(y-{y}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂y}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})+(z-{z}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂z}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0}).\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(z\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+1))=\\frac{2xz}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+1} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(z\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+1))=\\frac{2yz}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+1} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z} & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}(z\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+1))=\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the partial derivatives at $(x,y,z)=(0,0,3):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(0,0,3) & =\\frac{2(0)(3)}{{0}^{2}+{0}^{2}+1}=0 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y}(0,0,3) & =\\frac{2(0)(3)}{{0}^{2}+{0}^{2}+1}=0 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z}(0,0,3) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡({0}^{2}+{0}^{2}+1)=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we write down the equation of the tangent hyperplane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}w-0 & =(x-0)\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(0,0,3)+(y-0)\\frac{∂f}{∂y}(0,0,3)+(z-3)\\frac{∂f}{∂z}(0,0,3) \\\\ w & =0x+0y+0(z-3) \\\\ w & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373064 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373065 13194139535894 true] [17592186373064 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373066 13194139535894 true] [17592186373064 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373067 13194139535894 true] [17592186373064 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373068 13194139535894 true] [17592186373064 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373069 13194139535894 true] [17592186373064 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535894 true] [17592186373064 1041 "selection" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373064 1104 #edb/ref 17592186373066 13194139535894 true] [17592186373064 1110 #uuid "0558deff-b3e5-5351-b941-1c2b3da58583" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373065 1034 "2x+y-z+w+3=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373065 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373065 1111 #uuid "fe297a96-c326-5c70-92d5-b72611017161" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373066 1034 "w=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373066 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373066 1111 #uuid "97d9c461-4966-591e-b988-a0b158856f23" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373067 1034 "x-2z+w+6=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373067 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373067 1111 #uuid "9a54af84-5ca4-5cf9-8417-c81dc32207e2" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373068 1034 "z+w-3=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373068 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373068 1111 #uuid "9f56ad89-9b4a-59b7-bce2-1e2e689d5adc" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373069 1034 "x-z-w+3=" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373069 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373069 1111 #uuid "18c5017a-b9fe-5c8b-8da3-a250d5bf015f" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373070 1017 #edb/ref 17592186373071 13194139535894 true] [17592186373070 1089 "q-129557" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373070 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535894 true] [17592186373070 1100 "At which point on the surface $z=3{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}$ is the tangent plane perpendicular to the vector  $v=⟨4,-2,-1⟩?$" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373070 1113 #uuid "3931f2ba-4a22-55c7-b50e-cc4f49099005" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373070 1145 "The Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the surface $z=f(x,y)$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ on the surface can be written as\n\n$$\nz-{z}_{0}=(x-{x}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂x}({x}_{0},{y}_{0})+(y-{y}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂y}({x}_{0},{y}_{0}),\n$$\n\nwhere $⟨\\frac{∂f}{∂x}({x}_{0},{y}_{0}),\\frac{∂f}{∂y}({x}_{0},{y}_{0}),-1⟩$ represents a normal vector to the tangent plane.\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(3{x}^{2}+{y}^{2})=6x \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3{x}^{2}+{y}^{2})=2y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the normal vector to the tangent plane is \n\n$$\n⟨6x,\\,2y,\\,-1⟩.\n$$\n\nOur tangent plane should be perpendicular to $⟨4,-2,-1⟩.$ So, the normal vector of that plane must be parallel to that vector. In other words, for some constant $c$, we must have\n\n$$\nc\\cdot ⟨6x,\\,2y,\\,-1⟩=⟨4,-2,-1⟩.\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding coordinates, we obtain the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}6cx=4 \\\\ 2cy=-2 \\\\ -c=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $c=1.$ Substituting this into the first equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n6(1)x=4\\,⟹\\,x=\\frac{2}{3}.\n$$\n\nAnd substituting $c=1$ into the second equation, we have \n\n$$\n2(1)y=-2\\,⟹\\,y=-1.\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $x=\\frac{2}{3}$ and $y=-1$ into our function, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =3{(\\frac{2}{3})}^{2}+(-1)^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}+1 \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the tangent plane is perpendicular to the vector $v$ at $(\\frac{2}{3},-1,\\frac{7}{3}).$" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373072 13194139535894 true] [17592186373071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373073 13194139535894 true] [17592186373071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373074 13194139535894 true] [17592186373071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373075 13194139535894 true] [17592186373071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373076 13194139535894 true] [17592186373071 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535894 true] [17592186373071 1041 "selection" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373071 1104 #edb/ref 17592186373076 13194139535894 true] [17592186373071 1110 #uuid "5cd4d301-a2de-5407-bcfc-20238120cf2a" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373072 1034 "(1,0,3)" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373072 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373072 1111 #uuid "a4d8e463-dd74-5e0c-946e-3ac53b74d6d1" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373073 1034 "(-1,-1,4)" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373073 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373073 1111 #uuid "8cf70ef8-5f83-5690-a007-37f7cf9f5a89" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373074 1034 "(0,1,1)" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373074 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373074 1111 #uuid "b2f132d1-d9d8-5666-9d33-d6391dd90a2d" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373075 1034 "(-\\frac{1}{3},0,\\frac{1}{9})" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373075 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373075 1111 #uuid "a9f5839a-7eb3-52ea-929b-d7e09929962c" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373076 1034 "(\\frac{2}{3},-1,\\frac{7}{3})" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373076 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373076 1111 #uuid "f5e53bc7-319e-545b-ac83-a5fc8e153d64" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373077 1017 #edb/ref 17592186373078 13194139535894 true] [17592186373077 1089 "q-73853" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373077 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535894 true] [17592186373077 1100 "Find the equation of the tangent hyperplane to the hypersurface $w={x}^{2}yz+x{y}^{2}z+xy{z}^{2}$ at the point $(1,-1,1,-1).$" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373077 1113 #uuid "814e44d6-f25f-5610-a620-4493f6068fe6" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373077 1145 "The Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the hypersurface $w=f(x,y,z)$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0},{w}_{0})$ on the hypersurface can be written as\n\n$$\nw-{w}_{0}=(x-{x}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂x}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})+(y-{y}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂y}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})+(z-{z}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂z}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0}).\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}yz+x{y}^{2}z+xy{z}^{2})=2xyz+{y}^{2}z+y{z}^{2} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{2}yz+x{y}^{2}z+xy{z}^{2})={x}^{2}z+2xyz+x{z}^{2} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z} & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}({x}^{2}yz+x{y}^{2}z+xy{z}^{2})={x}^{2}y+x{y}^{2}+2xyz\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the partial derivatives at $(x,y,z)=(1,-1,1):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(1,-1,1) & =2(1)(-1)(1)+(-1)^{2}(1)+(-1)(1)^{2}=-2 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y}(1,-1,1) & =(1)^{2}(1)+2(1)(-1)(1)+(1)(1)^{2}=0 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z}(1,-1,1) & =(1)^{2}(-1)+(1)(-1)^{2}+2(1)(-1)(1)=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we write down the equation of the tangent hyperplane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}w-(-1) & =(x-1)\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(1,-1,1)+(y-(-1))\\frac{∂f}{∂y}(1,-1,1)+(z-1)\\frac{∂f}{∂z}(1,-1,1) \\\\ w+1 & =-2(x-1)+0\\cdot (y+1)-2(z-1) \\\\ w+1 & =-2x-2z+4 \\\\ 2x+2z+w-3 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373078 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373079 13194139535894 true] [17592186373078 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373080 13194139535894 true] [17592186373078 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373081 13194139535894 true] [17592186373078 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373082 13194139535894 true] [17592186373078 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373083 13194139535894 true] [17592186373078 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535894 true] [17592186373078 1041 "selection" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373078 1104 #edb/ref 17592186373081 13194139535894 true] [17592186373078 1110 #uuid "e278fc4f-1be6-5d14-8345-b25aa1f523de" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373079 1034 "2x+2z-w-5=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373079 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373079 1111 #uuid "d51f5d88-ecc0-541a-9d3f-1ac29aa154a2" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373080 1034 "2x+2y+2z+w-1=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373080 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373080 1111 #uuid "31adcf8c-64d3-5197-875a-9cb6c234498f" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373081 1034 "2x+2z+w-3=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373081 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373081 1111 #uuid "45acfdad-b257-5d16-9f55-10b5224d4145" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373082 1034 "2x-2y+2z+w-5=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373082 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373082 1111 #uuid "ba820757-5657-5c73-9b61-fb9be87f5678" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373083 1034 "2x-2z+w+1=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373083 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373083 1111 #uuid "6f6019d1-c191-5452-97fe-ceae090b4d0b" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373084 1017 #edb/ref 17592186373085 13194139535894 true] [17592186373084 1089 "q-73854" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373084 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535894 true] [17592186373084 1100 "Find the equation of the tangent hyperplane to the hypersurface $w=\\sqrt{xyz}$ at the point $(2,2,4,4).$" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373084 1113 #uuid "857660e1-66dc-54a7-9d67-d421d1b93206" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373084 1145 "The Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the hypersurface $w=f(x,y,z)$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0},{w}_{0})$ on the hypersurface can be written as\n\n$$\nw-{w}_{0}=(x-{x}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂x}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})+(y-{y}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂y}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})+(z-{z}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂z}({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0}).\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\sqrt{xyz})=\\frac{\\sqrt{yz}}{2\\sqrt{x}} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\sqrt{xyz})=\\frac{\\sqrt{xz}}{2\\sqrt{y}} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z} & =\\frac{∂}{∂z}(\\sqrt{xyz})=\\frac{\\sqrt{xy}}{2\\sqrt{z}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the partial derivatives at $(x,y,z)=(2,2,4):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(2,2,4) & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2\\cdot 4}}{2\\sqrt{2}}=1 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y}(2,2,4) & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2\\cdot 4}}{2\\sqrt{2}}=1 \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z}(2,2,4) & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2\\cdot 2}}{2\\sqrt{4}}=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we write down the equation of the tangent hyperplane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}w-4 & =(x-2)\\frac{∂f}{∂x}(2,2,4)+(y-2)\\frac{∂f}{∂y}(2,2,4)+(z-4)\\frac{∂f}{∂z}(2,2,4) \\\\ w-4 & =(x-2)+(y-2)+\\frac{1}{2}(z-4) \\\\ w-4 & =x+y+\\frac{z}{2}-6 \\\\ -x-y-\\frac{z}{2}+w+2 & =0 \\\\ 2x+2y+z-2w-4 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373085 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373086 13194139535894 true] [17592186373085 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373087 13194139535894 true] [17592186373085 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373088 13194139535894 true] [17592186373085 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373089 13194139535894 true] [17592186373085 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373090 13194139535894 true] [17592186373085 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535894 true] [17592186373085 1041 "selection" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373085 1104 #edb/ref 17592186373087 13194139535894 true] [17592186373085 1110 #uuid "4758857a-a3a0-5052-bea6-533c5f73a818" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373086 1034 "2x-2y-z+2w-4=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373086 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373086 1111 #uuid "3f750ca8-2270-5d92-9d6a-4bc9e83eab6f" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373087 1034 "2x+2y+z-2w-4=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373087 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373087 1111 #uuid "7de6f312-3658-58e3-bede-2982141da54a" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373088 1034 "2x+2y-z+2w-12=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373088 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373088 1111 #uuid "6e76d57f-f162-5492-a2c2-736f596bd743" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373089 1034 "2x+2y-z-2w+4=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373089 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373089 1111 #uuid "697850f0-8f17-5341-b29e-43617b43decf" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373090 1034 "2x-2y+2z-2w=0" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373090 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373090 1111 #uuid "091862d4-3969-534c-ac02-39ab825c2b5e" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373091 1017 #edb/ref 17592186373092 13194139535894 true] [17592186373091 1089 "q-73868" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373091 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535894 true] [17592186373091 1100 "At which points on the surface $z=x\\operatorname{ln}⁡y+{y}^{2}$ is the tangent plane perpendicular to the vector  $v\\,=\\,⟨0,2,-2⟩?$" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373091 1113 #uuid "a5dcf6aa-f2eb-5810-994b-1a62c1921645" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373091 1145 "The Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the surface $z=f(x,y)$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ on the surface can be written as\n\n$$\nz-{z}_{0}=(x-{x}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂x}({x}_{0},{y}_{0})+(y-{y}_{0})\\frac{∂f}{∂y}({x}_{0},{y}_{0}),\n$$\n\nwhere $⟨\\frac{∂f}{∂x}({x}_{0},{y}_{0}),\\frac{∂f}{∂y}({x}_{0},{y}_{0}),-1⟩$ represents a normal vector to the tangent plane.\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x\\operatorname{ln}⁡y+{y}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡y \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x\\operatorname{ln}⁡y+{y}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{x}{y}+2y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the normal vector to the tangent plane is \n\n$$\n⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡y,\\,\\frac{x}{y}+2y,\\,-1⟩\n$$\n\nOur tangent plane should be perpendicular to $⟨0,2,-2⟩.$ So, the normal vector of that plane must be parallel to that vector. In other words, for some constant $c$, we must have\n\n$$\nc\\cdot ⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡y,\\,\\frac{x}{y}+2y,\\,-1⟩=⟨0,2,-2⟩.\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding coordinates, we obtain the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}c\\operatorname{ln}⁡y=0 \\\\ \\frac{cx}{y}+2cy=2 \\\\ -c=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $c=2.$ Substituting this into the first equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{ln}⁡y=0\\,⟹\\,y=1.\n$$\n\nAnd substituting $c=2$ and $y=1$ into the second equation, we have \n\n$$\n\\frac{2x}{1}+2(2)(1)=2\\,⟹\\,x=-1.\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $x=-1$ and $y=1$ into our function, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =(-1)\\operatorname{ln}⁡1+{1}^{2} \\\\  & =0+1 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the tangent plane is perpendicular to the vector $v$ at $(-1,1,1).$" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373092 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373093 13194139535894 true] [17592186373092 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373094 13194139535894 true] [17592186373092 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373095 13194139535894 true] [17592186373092 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373096 13194139535894 true] [17592186373092 1000 #edb/ref 17592186373097 13194139535894 true] [17592186373092 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535894 true] [17592186373092 1041 "selection" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373092 1104 #edb/ref 17592186373093 13194139535894 true] [17592186373092 1110 #uuid "7be8efd6-03a3-5799-ac4e-ae887fd5c4d3" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373093 1034 "(-1,1,1)" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373093 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373093 1111 #uuid "772a417e-9a64-5b5b-ad16-3d2ff843e1cc" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373094 1034 "(2,1,1)" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373094 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535894 true] [17592186373094 1111 #uuid "67cd2924-839f-5eae-83d5-dbf0495363f8" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373095 1034 "$(1,-1,1)$ only" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373095 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535894 true] [17592186373095 1111 #uuid "b2a201e5-70c0-5a3e-ae8c-d93a58822524" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373096 1034 "$(-1,1,1)$ and $(1,-1,1)$" 13194139535894 true] [17592186373096 1103 #edb/ref 